{"term": {"label": "仁", "variants": []}, "source": {"id": "5A", "url": "https://ctext.org/mengzi/wan-zhang-i", "title": "萬章上", "description": "萬章問曰：「舜往于田，號泣于旻天，何為其號泣也？」\n孟子曰：「怨慕也。」\n萬章曰：「父母愛之，喜而不忘；父母惡之，勞而不怨。然則舜怨乎？」\n曰：「長息問於公明高曰：『舜往于田，則吾既得聞命矣；號泣于旻天，于父母，則吾不知也。』公明高曰：『是非爾所知也。』夫公明高以孝子之心，為不若是恝，我竭力耕田，共為子職而已矣，父母之", "occurrences": 5, "data": null}, "network": {"directed": false, "multigraph": false, "graph": {}, "nodes": [{"form": "中", "id": "中"}, {"form": "人", "id": "人"}, {"form": "仁", "id": "仁"}, {"form": "命", "id": "命"}, {"form": "封", "id": "封"}, {"form": "尊", "id": "尊"}, {"form": "年", "id": "年"}, {"form": "弟", "id": "弟"}, {"form": "昔", "id": "昔"}, {"form": "樂", "id": "樂"}, {"form": "畎畝", "id": "畎畝"}, {"form": "義", "id": "義"}, {"form": "至", "id": "至"}, {"form": "處", "id": "處"}, {"form": "誅", "id": "誅"}, {"form": "養", "id": "養"}], "edges": [{"weight": 3.378724525810097, "source": "尊", "target": "至"}, {"weight": 2.9732594177019327, "source": "尊", "target": "養"}, {"weight": 2.9732594177019327, "source": "養", "target": "至"}, {"weight": 3.784189633918261, "source": "封", "target": "弟"}, {"weight": 1.3097542839975562, "source": "人", "target": "仁"}, {"weight": 1.5328978353117662, "source": "人", "target": "弟"}, {"weight": 2.4624337939359418, "source": "處", "target": "仁"}, {"weight": 2.4624337939359418, "source": "處", "target": "年"}, {"weight": 3.378724525810097, "source": "處", "target": "義"}, {"weight": 3.378724525810097, "source": "處", "target": "中"}, {"weight": 3.6664065982618776, "source": "處", "target": "畎畝"}, {"weight": 2.9732594177019327, "source": "處", "target": "樂"}, {"weight": 2.8678989020441064, "source": "仁", "target": "誅"}, {"weight": 1.7692866133759964, "source": "仁", "target": "至"}, {"weight": 2.8678989020441064, "source": "仁", "target": "弟"}, {"weight": 1.951608170169951, "source": "仁", "target": "年"}, {"weight": 2.8678989020441064, "source": "仁", "target": "義"}, {"weight": 1.586965056582042, "source": "命", "target": "至"}, {"weight": 2.6855773452501515, "source": "命